            en: "3-bedroom apartment with 129 m² in good condition, standing out for its generous areas, excellent sun exposure and plenty of natural light. The property has a living room, semi-equipped kitchen, three bedrooms (one en-suite, all with built-in wardrobes) and two bathrooms. It has a balcony with unobstructed views of the countryside, air conditioning, double glazing, video intercom, parking space and storage. Located in an area with direct transport access to Lisbon and local shops, 7 minutes from the A8 motorway and 20 minutes from Lisbon. It is located a 5-minute walk from the future Póvoa da Galega Urban Park."
